WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
That is to say, except for the black soil

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,520
In the main courtyard, upstairs and in the corridor, all time stops

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,480
Then I don’t need paper to stock up on cans of rice and noodles.

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,480
You can put in the freshly prepared meals while they are still hot.

5
